OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud will
OL,6,Fthicken through the evening with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain developing during
OL,8,Fthe evening. Rain continuing
OL,9,Fovernight, occasionally heavy. Wind
OL,10,Feasing this evening. A mild night.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA wet start with outbreaks
OL,13,Fof rain, occasionally heavy. Perhaps
OL,14,Fbriefly drier during the afternoon but
OL,15,Fremaining mostly cloudy. Possible
OL,16,Ffurther patchy rain during the
OL,17,Fevening. Breezy in the south.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
